<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1500439504"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1701584064"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Take Me Hand"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Cécile Corbel"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Take Me Hand"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:35.616"><div begin="00:22.465" end="03:06.052"><p begin="00:22.465" end="00:26.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">In my dreams, I feel your light<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的梦里</span></p><p begin="00:26.190" end="00:29.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">I feel love is born again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱再次绽放</span></p><p begin="00:29.950" end="00:33.671" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Fireflies in the moonlight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">萤火虫</span></p><p begin="00:33.740" end="00:36.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Rising stars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如闪烁的繁星</span></p><p begin="00:37.420" end="00:44.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Remember the day I fell in love with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还记得吗</span></p><p begin="00:44.958" end="00:51.146" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Darling, won't you break my heart?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的 请不要伤害</span></p><p begin="00:52.867" end="00:56.647" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Take my hand now, stay close to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抓紧我的手</span></p><p begin="00:56.657" end="01:00.144" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Be my lover, won't you let me go?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成为我爱人</span></p><p begin="01:00.449" end="01:03.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Close your eyes now, and you will see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闭上你的眼睛</span></p><p begin="01:04.220" end="01:07.831" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">There's a rainbow for you and me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有道彩虹</span></p><p begin="01:22.430" end="01:26.183" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">As I wake up, I see your face<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我醒来</span></p><p begin="01:26.193" end="01:29.686" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">I feel love is born again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱再次绽放</span></p><p begin="01:29.906" end="01:33.483" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Cherry blossom, flying birds<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">樱花盛开</span></p><p begin="01:33.756" end="01:35.983" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">In the sky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在蓝天翱翔</span></p><p begin="01:37.397" end="01:44.772" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Can't you see the sun that is shining on the fields?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看见了吗</span></p><p begin="01:45.048" end="01:50.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Is it shining in your heart?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像闪烁在</span></p><p begin="01:52.864" end="01:56.435" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Take my hand now, stay close to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抓紧我的手</span></p><p begin="01:56.684" end="02:00.167" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Be my lover, won't you let me go?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成为我爱人</span></p><p begin="02:00.420" end="02:04.035" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Close your eyes now, and you will see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闭上你的眼睛</span></p><p begin="02:04.172" end="02:07.565" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">There's a rainbow for you and me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有道彩虹</span></p><p begin="02:07.575" end="02:13.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">And I dream of you every night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你出现在我梦中</span></p><p begin="02:14.798" end="02:20.807" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">'Cause there's only you in my mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为只有你</span></p><p begin="02:22.391" end="02:29.846" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Will you be a stranger or a friend in my life?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你愿成为</span></p><p begin="02:29.950" end="02:36.463" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Darling, won't you break my heart?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的 请不要伤害</span></p><p begin="02:37.835" end="02:41.648" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Take my hand now, stay close to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抓紧我的手</span></p><p begin="02:41.658" end="02:45.276" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Be my lover, won't you let me go?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成为我爱人</span></p><p begin="02:45.441" end="02:49.058" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Close your eyes now, and you will see<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闭上你的眼睛</span></p><p begin="02:49.133" end="02:52.494" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">There's a rainbow for you and me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有道彩虹</span></p><p begin="02:52.504" end="02:55.448" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Darling, take my hand now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连接你我的心</span></p><p begin="02:56.168" end="02:59.185" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Won't you stay close to me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">靠近我的心</span></p><p begin="02:59.913" end="03:03.561" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Won't you be my lover?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要放开我的手</span></p><p begin="03:03.721" end="03:06.052" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Won't you let me go?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有道彩虹</span></p></div></body></tt>